  "solution": {
    "text": "After closing of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> bulb or lamp become short circuited<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image78-6d2f89ea-6cbd-44b3-8dc6-48cb1e0fd20c.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 125px;\" /><br /><br /><br /><br />potential across <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> before closing of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Potential across <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> after closing of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />As <math><mi>P</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>2.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"n